type: NuclearReactor

name: '''
Big Subspaceium Reactor
'''
description: '''
this can power everything you build, goes well with the phighthouse power grid & whitehouseium battery, highly recommended to build this far away from the core, because if it's destroyed, it'll not be pretty for your core.
'''

